Calls the power of the Sun into a searing lance, doing [102, 137, 164, 188, 208 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage to the target and leaving a radius 1 area of searing light on the ground for 4 turns that does [51, 68, 82, 94, 104 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage to all foes within it.

The damage dealt will increase with your Spellpower.
